    "name": "Learning Task API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the routes mounted in src/app.ts.\n\nSet baseUrl if the server runs on a different host or port. Register or log in first; those requests save the JWT, username, and user UUID.\n\nCreate Story saves storySlug, storyUuid, and storyIdentifier. Add Comment saves commentId.\n\nEvery request body lists required and optional fields with sample values so you can replace them with real data. Optional query params are included on list endpoints. Remove a query param if you do not want that filter.\n\nAllowed story status values: draft, submitted, approved, rejected, published.\nAllowed story visibility values: public, followers_only.\nStory, like, and comment identifiers accept a slug, story UUID, or numeric story id.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
